# Files a `vercel deploy` from a local clone must never upload (Git deploys don't use this file).
# Secrets stay on the machine: Vercel's own Environment Variables hold production's values.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Installed and built on Vercel, not uploaded.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
packages/*/npm/dist
packages/*/npm/LICENSE
.git
